{"id":"beats-2e80a8","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ae17d89f-00ff-4074-8f22-73b6c0edf36a","text":"Fix: Config YAML display bug. Added explicit yaml struct tags for all config fields with underscores. Now, beats config displays all keys with underscores as intended. Tested with make build and output verified."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T13:02:31.345664Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
