{"id":"beats-a04b79","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-6065cf93-fa52-428b-8183-ac284345c615","text":"## Summary\n\nDone issues now always sort by most recently updated first, regardless of the user's chosen sort key.\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`: Computes an `effectiveSortKey` that overrides to `updated` for the DONE group. All four `sortGroup()` calls use this effective key.\n- `web/src/utils/sort.ts`: `sortIssuesWithinGroups()` forces updated sort when both issues are DONE, ensuring Board view also shows Done issues most-recent-first."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:07:15.183815Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-a04b79","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:07:21.04091Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-4b9dbe","type":"CREATE","payload":{"labels":["feature"],"title":"Save collapse/expanded state for statuses in index view to localStorage"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:09:38.559036Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-4b9dbe","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:09:38.58542Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-4b9dbe","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:09:53.444227Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-4b9dbe","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1cca99f9-9058-4bfe-b53b-7fc24bdaa9b5","text":"## Summary\n\nStatus group collapse/expanded state in the Backlog view is now persisted to localStorage per tab.\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`:\n  - On tab switch, reads saved state from `localStorage` key `beats-backlog-expanded-{tab}`. Falls back to the previous heuristic (expand non-empty groups except Done) if no saved state exists.\n  - `toggleGroup` now writes the updated expanded set to localStorage on every toggle.\n  - Parent/child tree node expansion (`expandedNodes`) is not persisted since it depends on which issues exist and is less stable."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:10:40.819698Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-4b9dbe","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:10:40.848721Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
