{"id":"beats-7a53ba","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"When adding task lists with `code` elements the layout shifts when going from rendered to editing. Also rendered task lists have different padding between task checklist box and text than in editing mode.\\\nExample:\n\n- [ ] Test\n\n- [ ] Test 2\n\n- [ ] Test with `code elements` inside list"},"created_at":"2026-05-24T15:50:08.588714Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2165bd","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"The collapse item icon when it has sub-issues is too small and very hard to click on. we should make the button larger","labels":["feature","bug"],"title":"Collapse button target too small"},"created_at":"2026-05-25T19:33:32.289713495Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
