{"id":"beats-2165bd","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-25T19:46:39.633243407Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2165bd","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-81b24131-fa39-4457-b14a-e85f2b63e19a","text":"## Summary\n\nEnlarged the sub-issue collapse/expand chevron in the backlog tree from a ~16×12px hit area to a 24×24px button.\n\n## Change\n\n`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — the chevron button on rows with children was `w-4` (16px wide) with no explicit height, so its effective click target was just the 12×12 SVG inside it.\n\nUpdated to `w-6 h-6 -m-1` plus a subtle hover background:\n\n- `w-6 h-6` → 24×24px click target (4× the previous area)\n- `-m-1` → negative margin collapses the visual footprint back to 16×16, so the row layout, chevron position, and indent column are unchanged\n- `rounded hover:bg-[var(--color-bg-hover)]` → adds visual affordance on hover\n\n## Verification\n\n- `make frontend` builds cleanly with no TS errors\n- Layout slot stays exactly 16px wide → no shift in neighboring elements or child indent"},"created_at":"2026-05-25T20:46:50.175632472Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2165bd","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-01d3ef0b-0ba9-4607-96bf-12014c348877","text":"## Follow-up tweaks\n\n- Added `cursor-pointer` so the chevron reads as clickable\n- Switched hover background from `--color-bg-hover` to `bg-white/10` so the button highlight is visible regardless of whether the row itself is in its hover state"},"created_at":"2026-05-25T22:08:48.831255508Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
