{"id":"beats-b75e16","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"The [README.md](http://README.md) is currently a collection of random thoughts more so than a proper documentation and instructions file. We need to rewrite the README to give a brief one-liner overview of what beats is and who it is for, followed by a Quickstart Guide, Installation instructions, Usage, Agentic Usage, etc.","labels":["improvement"],"title":"Improved documentation"},"created_at":"2026-05-27T11:52:10.60906939Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
