{"id":"beats-47011a","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9279df20-fe5f-4878-8537-db4631bb00c5","text":"## Summary\n\nSplit `handlers.go` (594 lines) into two files:\n\n- **`handlers.go`** (455 lines) — HTTP handler methods only\n- **`responses.go`** (138 lines) — response types (`IssueResponse`, `DependencyResponse`, `CommentResponse`, `PendingResponse`, `PendingEventEntry`), serialization helpers (`issueToResponse`, `getUser`), and the `isMeaningfulActivityEvent` filter\n\n`metrics.go` was already separate. Build and all tests pass."},"created_at":"2026-05-28T07:13:45.198791479Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
