{"id":"beats-dd51a6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-92457be2-2e56-4c94-80f5-2dbcd8e56fc4","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded a cycle indicator icon to backlog issue rows in `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`.\n\nWhen an issue has a `cycle_id`, a small cycle/refresh icon appears between the labels and the estimate badge. It uses the same icon as the Cycles nav entry and context menu, styled in `text-[var(--color-text-muted)]` to match the surrounding badges. Hovering shows the cycle ID as a tooltip."},"created_at":"2026-06-01T12:09:38.153013394Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.158 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
