{"id":"beats-dd51a6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-962d73f5-cf87-4eee-98c6-cd318f265693","text":"## Update\n\nRefined the cycle indicator based on feedback:\n\n- Changed from refresh icon to **circled play icon** (matching the cycle timeline icons)\n- Added **cycle number** next to the icon (e.g., \"▶ 8\")\n- Fetches cycles from `/api/cycles` on mount to build a `cycleId → number` lookup map\n- Tooltip shows the cycle number on hover"},"created_at":"2026-06-01T12:30:07.501284856Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.158 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
