{"id":"beats-b28e97","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Show confirmation toasts for actions such as creating issues, updating statuses, merges, transitions, commenting, etc.\\n\\n## Current State\\n\\nAd-hoc `toast` state exists in `Backlog.tsx` and `IssueDetail.tsx` with duplicated inline rendering. Triggers are limited to clipboard copy and draft save errors.\\n\\n## Plan\\n\\n1. **Extract a shared `Toast` component** (`web/src/components/ui/Toast.tsx`) with fade-in/fade-out animation, auto-dismiss after ~2s\\n2. **Create a `ToastProvider` context** with a `showToast(message)` function so any component can fire toasts without local state\\n3. **Mount at the app root** (in `App.tsx`) so toasts work across all views\\n4. **Replace existing inline toast code** in `Backlog.tsx` and `IssueDetail.tsx` with the shared hook\\n5. **Add toast triggers** for:\\n   - [ ] Issue creation\\n   - [ ] Status transitions\\n   - [ ] Story point / field updates\\n   - [ ] Comment added\\n   - [ ] Branch merge\\n   - [ ] Clipboard copy (already exists, migrate)\\n   - [ ] Draft save errors (already exists, migrate)","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@nicbet-wsl.local\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-06-11T06:39:45.1272686Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-b28e97","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-11T06:22:34.288621069Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-b28e97","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4ec6019f-4664-4fd8-a440-04833f4fbc7e","text":"## Summary\n\nExtracted a shared toast notification system and wired it up across the app.\n\n**New:**\n- `web/src/components/ui/Toast.tsx` — `ToastProvider` context with `useToast()` hook. Fixed-position toast at bottom center, fade-in/fade-out transition, auto-dismiss after 2s (configurable).\n\n**Changed:**\n- `web/src/main.tsx` — wraps `\u003cApp\u003e` in `\u003cToastProvider\u003e` so all components have access\n- `web/src/components/ui/index.ts` — barrel export for `ToastProvider` and `useToast`\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — toast on issue creation via NewIssueModal\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — replaced inline toast state; toasts on inline create, status/estimate/label updates, clipboard copy\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx` — replaced inline toast state; toasts on all draft saves (status, comment, field edits), errors (3s), clipboard copy, branch merge\n\n**Rationale:** Duplicated inline toast logic in Backlog and IssueDetail was replaced with a single context-based provider. Mounting at the root means any future component can call `showToast()` without local state."},"created_at":"2026-06-11T06:40:11.035038208Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
