{"id":"beats-834350","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4685ff86-8843-44a9-972b-c531cf2c074f","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented the `beats serve` headless HTTP server subcommand.\n\n### New file: `cmd/beats/serve.go`\n- Cobra command with `--addr` flag (default `:8080`)\n- Loads/auto-generates server signing key from `.beats/server.key`\n- Loads authorized keys from `.beats/authorized_keys`\n- Initializes `NonceStore` (5 min TTL) for auth challenges\n- Mounts MCP-over-HTTP via `mcp.NewStreamableHTTPHandler` on `/mcp` with auth\n- Graceful shutdown on SIGTERM/SIGINT with 5s drain timeout via `signal.NotifyContext`\n\n### Modified: `internal/server/server.go`\n- Added `Headless` flag and `MCPHandler http.Handler` field to `Server` struct\n\n### Modified: `internal/server/router.go`\n- Exported `SetupRoutes()` (was `setupRoutes`)\n- Added MCP endpoint routing (`POST/GET/DELETE /mcp`) with conditional auth wrapping\n- Headless mode short-circuits before static asset serving\n\n### Modified: `internal/auth/middleware.go`\n- Added `RequireAuthHandler()` variant for wrapping `http.Handler` (not just `http.HandlerFunc`)\n\n### Modified: `internal/mcpserver/server.go`\n- Added `RegisterTools(srv, cfg, httpReq)` public function for HTTP transport\n- `httpUserOverride` field on `toolset` propagates authenticated identity from JWT to event `CreatedBy`\n\n### Acceptance criteria walkthrough\n- [x] `beats serve` starts HTTP server on configurable address\n- [x] REST API endpoints served with auth middleware\n- [x] MCP endpoint served with auth middleware\n- [x] Write mutex on event appends (existing `s.mu` on Server)\n- [x] Server reads `.beats/authorized_keys` for user verification\n- [x] JWT signing key generated and persisted\n- [x] Graceful shutdown on SIGTERM\n- [x] Health check endpoint (`GET /healthz`, no auth)"},"created_at":"2026-06-11T13:12:34.356335694Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
