{"id":"beats-72811f","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0896531a-99a5-4b92-b8e5-9d2850dc7472","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented `beats login`, `beats logout`, and `beats whoami` CLI commands for remote server authentication.\n\n### New files\n\n**`internal/auth/sshkeys.go`** — SSH key discovery\n- `DiscoverSSHKeys()` scans `~/.ssh/id_ed25519`, `~/.ssh/id_rsa`, `~/.ssh/id_ecdsa` + ssh-agent\n- `SSHKey` type with `Signer`, `Path`, `Comment`, `Label()`\n- `PreferEd25519()` auto-selects the best key\n\n**`internal/config/remote.go`** — Token persistence\n- `SaveRemoteConfig()` / `LoadRemoteConfig()` / `ClearRemoteConfig()` for `.beats/remote.yaml`\n- File created with `0600` permissions\n- Auto-adds `remote.yaml` and `server.key` to `.beats/.gitignore`\n\n**`cmd/beats/login.go`** — `beats login \u003curl\u003e`\n- Discovers SSH keys, selects best available (prefers ed25519)\n- Requests challenge nonce from `POST /auth/challenge`\n- Signs nonce with SSH private key\n- Sends signed response to `POST /auth/verify`\n- Saves JWT token to `.beats/remote.yaml`\n- Displays identity decoded from JWT claims\n\n**`cmd/beats/logout.go`** — `beats logout`\n- Clears `.beats/remote.yaml`\n\n**`cmd/beats/whoami.go`** — `beats whoami`\n- Shows mode (local/remote), server URL, identity, token expiry\n- Warns if token is expired\n\n### Modified files\n- **`config.go`** — `LoadConfig()` now merges remote config from `.beats/remote.yaml` into `Config.Remote`\n\n### Tests (10 new)\n- `sshkeys_test.go` (4): key discovery from files, PreferEd25519, empty list, Label formatting\n- `remote_test.go` (5): save+load round-trip, missing file, clear, clear missing, gitignore dedup\n- Fixed flaky `TestRequireAuth_TamperedToken` (payload tampering instead of signature byte flip)"},"created_at":"2026-06-11T13:22:13.317116956Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
