{"id":"beats-703976","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ce852662-c66a-4cfd-ba8b-c95508004278","text":"## Summary\n\nWhen `cfg.Remote.URL` is configured, `beats board` now reverse-proxies all `/api/*` and `/auth/*` requests to the remote beats server with the JWT bearer token injected. Static assets remain served locally.\n\n### Modified files\n\n**`internal/server/server.go`** — added `ProxyURL` and `ProxyToken` fields to `Server`\n\n**`internal/server/router.go`** — `SetupRoutes()` now has a proxy mode branch:\n- Creates a `httputil.NewSingleHostReverseProxy` targeting the remote URL\n- Custom `Director` injects `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e` on every forwarded request\n- Custom `ErrorHandler` returns 502 with `\"remote server unreachable\"` message\n- Registers method-specific proxy routes (`GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/{path...}`, `POST /auth/{path...}`)\n- Local API handlers only registered when not in proxy mode\n- Health check, static assets, MCP endpoint remain local\n\n**`cmd/beats/board.go`** — `runBoard()` checks `cfg.Remote.URL` and sets `srv.ProxyURL`/`srv.ProxyToken`\n\n### Tests (4 new)\n\n| Test | Coverage |\n|---|---|\n| `TestProxyMode_ForwardsAPIWithToken` | Backend receives request with correct path and `Bearer` header, response proxied back |\n| `TestProxyMode_BackendUnreachable` | Returns 502 with clear error message |\n| `TestProxyMode_HealthzStillLocal` | `/healthz` returns 200 even when proxy backend is down |\n| `TestProxyMode_AuthEndpointsForwarded` | `/auth/challenge` forwarded to backend |\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [x] `beats board` detects remote config and enables proxy mode\n- [x] `/api/*` routes proxied to remote with auth header\n- [x] Static assets served locally\n- [x] Frontend works identically in both modes (same localhost API)\n- [x] Proxy timeout and error handling (502 + descriptive message)\n- [x] Clear error message when remote is unreachable"},"created_at":"2026-06-11T13:58:19.737516091Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
