{"id":"beats-48524c","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"When viewing the issue details for a child issue, the status indicator for the parent issue in \"Sub-Issue of x\" subtitle is the status of the child issue instead of the status of the parent issue.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"aJ","title":"Wrong status icon on parent issue"},"created_at":"2026-06-12T11:53:57.790304447Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
