{"id":"beats-29bf29","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2e26973b-ead0-4b09-a426-0d613ee46f57","text":"## Summary\n\nRemoved the badge border from the status selector in the new issue dialog and added status icons.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/InlineDropdown.tsx`** — added `icon` field to `DropdownOption` (renders in both trigger and dropdown rows, takes precedence over `dot`). Added `borderless` prop to remove the border from the trigger button.\n\n**`web/src/components/NewIssueModal/NewIssueModal.tsx`** — `STATUS_OPTIONS` now includes `StatusIcon` for each status value. The status dropdown uses `borderless` for a clean, border-free appearance."},"created_at":"2026-06-13T06:47:15.187374126Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
