{"id":"beats-7fcd0b","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1001b667-8b54-47f0-8649-ffe19c7dc8e3","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed keyboard events leaking to the backlog while the filter menu is open.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — added `showFilterMenuRef` and an early return in the keyboard handler when the filter menu is open. The `F` shortcut still works to toggle the menu, but all other keys (arrow navigation, shortcuts) are suppressed while it's visible."},"created_at":"2026-06-13T07:04:43.068202949Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
