{"id":"beats-b441fa","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e8d83c6e-ad60-4a37-86b5-d8608d684b22","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed description flicker when saving edits in the issue detail view.\n\n### Root cause\n\n`saveDraft` calls `onRefresh()` then sets `editingField = null` in its `finally` block. The edit mode exits before the refreshed issue data arrives, causing the markdown view to briefly render the old `issue.description` from props.\n\n### Fix\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`** — added `optimisticDescription` state. When saving, the edited text is stored optimistically and used for display (`optimisticDescription ?? issue.description`). Once the refresh updates `issue.description` to match, the optimistic value is cleared. No visible flicker."},"created_at":"2026-06-13T07:51:01.528537139Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
