{"id":"beats-c35c55","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"When viewing the issue details view for a parent issue, we see a summary table for the issues sub-issues. The ordering of issues in that table is not the same as the order we have in the backlog.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b3g","title":"Ordering of sub-issues not reflected in sub-issues table"},"created_at":"2026-06-15T05:51:53.109768328Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
