{"id":"beats-068b94","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"In dependency view, we show all dependencies. It would be nice if we could have a toggle to show/hide complete (default: hide) which is where both sides of the dependency are marked DONE.","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b3g","title":"Ability to toggle hiding of completed dependencies"},"created_at":"2026-06-15T06:16:17.998349402Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
