{"id":"beats-70174a","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"When clicking on a link in the rendered description of an issue in the issue details view, we briefly enter editing mode before navigating to the link. I think in these cases we shouldn't enter edit mode.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b5I","title":"Clicking on a link in the description enters editing mode"},"created_at":"2026-06-15T07:19:45.345494622Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
