{"id":"beats-83ce0f","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-88bb98fd-cc31-4f94-99f4-73ef175a4a7a","text":"## Final: 39.9% → 86.6%\n\nAdded 50+ tests across 5 new files:\n\n- ✅ `storage_test.go` — AppendEvent: file creation, append, newline separation, payload preservation\n- ✅ `read_test.go` — ReadEvents: empty file, missing file, malformed JSON, multiple events; ReadArchivedEvents: missing + with data\n- ✅ `archive_test.go` — ArchiveEvents: move to archive, backup creation, append to existing archive, empty archive/active lists\n- ✅ `merge_test.go` — mergeUpdatePayloads: all 11 fields individually, nil-preserves-existing, timestamp update; mergeCommentPayloads: same-ID/different-ID; pruneNoopUpdates: per-field noop, non-existent issue passthrough, non-update passthrough, labels/deps equality; strSlicesEqual/depsEqual; countLines edge cases; rewriteFile atomic + empty\n- ✅ `project_state_test.go` — projectCommittedState: all CREATE fields, default BACKLOG, UPDATE application for all fields, DELETE marks deleted, update-on-missing ignored, empty input\n\nExceeds the 80% target."},"created_at":"2026-06-15T16:01:09.884214462Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
