{"id":"beats-603536","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\n\nNo pipeline exists to cut a release with downloadable binaries. Users currently need `go install` which requires a Go toolchain.\n\n## Needed\n\n- goreleaser config (`.goreleaser.yaml`) for cross-compilation: linux/mac/windows x amd64/arm64\n- GitHub Actions workflow for tagged releases (`v*` tag triggers build + publish)\n- Embed frontend assets before build (the `make frontend` step)\n- Homebrew tap formula (optional, nice-to-have)\n- Checksums + signing for binary verification\n\n## Output\n\n`gh release create v1.0.0` produces downloadable binaries for all platforms with embedded web UI assets.","estimate":3,"labels":["improvement"],"status":"PLANNED","title":"Release automation — goreleaser + cross-compiled binaries"},"created_at":"2026-06-15T19:40:26.551226943Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
