{"id":"beats-d346a7","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0cc57001-0d3e-49fc-9564-be6e3beb3403","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `CHANGELOG.md` following [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) format.\n\nRetroactively documented three releases based on git history:\n- **v0.1.0** — initial release (CLI, event sourcing, basic commands)\n- **v0.2.0** — Web UI, comments, dependencies, archive, interactive mode, v2 data model\n- **v0.3.0** — distributed mode, auth, inbox, cycles, branch workflows, dashboard, v3 data model\n\nEach release is organized into Added/Changed/Fixed sections. The `[Unreleased]` section is ready for future work toward v1.0.0.\n\nRelease dates for v0.1.0 and v0.2.0 are approximate — no git tags exist to pin exact dates."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T06:36:03.188037115Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-d346a7","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9b728225-b4e5-4183-9f4b-9e1ed5eff176","text":"## Summary (update)\n\nAdded `make release VERSION=x.y.z` target to `Makefile`. It:\n\n1. **Guards**: clean working tree, tag doesn't already exist, `[Unreleased]` section present in CHANGELOG\n2. **Bumps**: `CLIVersion` in `internal/version/version.go`\n3. **Stamps**: moves `[Unreleased]` content into a dated `[x.y.z] - YYYY-MM-DD` section\n4. **Commits**: stages both files and commits as `release: vx.y.z`\n5. **Tags**: creates annotated `v*` tag — this is what triggers the existing CI build + GitHub Release workflow\n\nPrints a reminder to `git push origin main vx.y.z` to publish."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T06:38:59.361367349Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
