{"id":"beats-e4397a","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c1aeda35-52c0-410b-b2e0-ed2bab1c9082","text":"## Summary\n\nRewrote `README.md` to cover all sections from the issue spec. Key additions vs the previous version:\n\n- **Install section**: added binary download from GitHub Releases, `go install`, and Docker options alongside existing from-source instructions\n- **Distributed mode**: new section covering `beats serve` setup, `authorized_keys`, JWT auth flow, `beats login`/`logout`/`whoami`, proxy mode, and Docker deployment\n- **Configuration**: complete `.beats/config.yaml` reference with cycles, labels, contributors, automations, and role-based permissions (with available capabilities listed)\n- **CLI reference**: added branch workflows (`start`/`review`/`merge`), inbox, cycles, and `migrate` commands\n- **MCP tools table**: updated to include `beats_start` and `beats_merge`\n- **Project structure**: added directory tree with one-line descriptions\n- **License**: linked to the new MIT LICENSE file\n\nKept the existing content that was already good: intro pitch, quickstart, web UI description, MCP setup instructions, architecture paragraph."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T06:43:20.479633353Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-e4397a","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-56e54958-34bd-4b7d-b9e9-2a329cf1e063","text":"## Summary (update 2)\n\nCreated `docs/design.md` — a fresh architecture document based on the actual codebase. Covers:\n\n- **Event sourcing**: event types, JSONL storage, projection, collapsed writes, archiving\n- **Data model**: Issue struct, dependencies, sort order, status workflow\n- **Transport abstraction**: Transport interface, LocalTransport vs RemoteTransport, Client wrapper\n- **Storage layer**: append-only semantics, file layout, snapshot cache\n- **HTTP server**: projection cache, pending events, SSE, proxy mode\n- **Authentication**: SSH challenge-response → JWT flow, permissions/capabilities\n- **MCP server**: tool registration, identity resolution\n- **Configuration**: project vs user config, key settings\n- **Branch workflows**: start/merge/review, git lock\n- **Data model versioning**: v1→v2→v3 migration history\n\nUpdated the README architecture section link to point to `docs/design.md` instead of the stale `design_docs/DESIGN.md`.\n\nThe old `design_docs/` directory is left in place — it can be removed separately if desired."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T06:58:07.675412987Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
