{"id":"beats-1e720d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-32eb06bf-0be1-4487-a917-5ac8d89658d9","text":"## Summary\n\n**Root cause**: `Backlog.tsx` line 693 — when filter menu is open, the keyboard handler returns early for all keys, including Escape. No way to close the menu without a mouse.\n\n**Fix**: Added Escape check before the early return. When filter menu is open and Escape is pressed, it closes the menu and restores backlog keyboard nav. All other keys remain blocked while the menu is open."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:44:01.201497867Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-1e720d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:44:07.185508621Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-a24553","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@nicbet-wsl.local\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:44:48.927190693Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-a24553","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9e704403-7918-4843-a8e9-696346463a73","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded focus trap, auto-focus, and focus restoration to `Modal.tsx`:\n\n- **Focus trap**: Tab/Shift+Tab cycles through focusable elements within the modal. If no focusable elements exist, Tab is suppressed.\n- **Auto-focus**: On open, focus moves to the first focusable element inside the dialog (falls back to the dialog container itself).\n- **Focus restoration**: On close, focus returns to the element that was active when the modal opened.\n- Dialog container has `tabIndex={-1}` and `outline-none` as a focusable fallback.\n\nAll consumers of `\u003cModal\u003e` (e.g. `NewIssueModal`) get these behaviors automatically."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:45:40.80158941Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-a24553","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:45:45.391302357Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-fc2d80","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@nicbet-wsl.local\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:47:58.784629642Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-fc2d80","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-551bbd77-67ac-4e6b-8dc0-188614257f2f","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `/` keyboard shortcut to focus the backlog search input. Added `onSearchFocus` prop to `Backlog` component, wired through `App.tsx`. The existing Escape handler in the search input already clears the query and returns focus to the list. Guarded by `isEditableTarget()` so `/` doesn't fire when already in an input."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:49:22.368587065Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-fc2d80","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:49:35.115041334Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
