{"id":"beats-c66e8d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-62a22455-c93f-44e6-bc34-2505da9e4d24","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded collapsible sidebar to the Layout component.\n\n**Expanded** (default, `w-62`): full sidebar with labels, search/new issue buttons, projects list, user name. Collapse toggle (hamburger icon) in header.\n\n**Collapsed** (`w-12`): icon-only nav with tooltip on hover. Logo doubles as expand button. Inbox unread badge renders as a small dot on the icon. Projects section hidden. User section shows avatar only.\n\n- Smooth 200ms width transition\n- State persisted in localStorage (`beats-sidebar-collapsed`)\n- `NavItem` component updated with `collapsed` prop for icon-only mode\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx` — collapsed state, toggle, conditional rendering throughout sidebar"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T12:45:31.689306Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
