{"id":"beats-3b16a4","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8802fe8d-e53a-48b8-b58c-4567f7d20fa3","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded full keyboard navigation to the Notifications (formerly Inbox) view:\n\n- **J/↓** and **K/↑**: navigate between issue groups\n- **→**: expand older events on focused card\n- **←**: collapse older events on focused card\n- **Enter**: open the focused issue\n- **R**: mark all as read\n- Visual focus: accent border + ring on active card, auto-scrolls into view\n- Focus resets when switching New/Read tabs\n\nAlso as part of this work:\n- Renamed \"Inbox\" to \"Notifications\" across sidebar, command palette, toast, keyboard help\n- Swapped tray icon to bell icon in sidebar and command palette\n- Updated `G` chord: `G I` = Issues, `G B` = Board, `G N` = Notifications\n- Added spacing between columns in keyboard help dialog\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx` — keyboard handler, focus state, expand/collapse, mark-read shortcut\n- `web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx` — label + icon rename\n- `web/src/components/CommandPalette/CommandPalette.tsx` — label + icon rename\n- `web/src/components/KeyboardHelp/KeyboardHelp.tsx` — Notifications section, updated G chord labels, column spacing\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — updated G chord targets, toast text"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:34:32.913075684Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3b16a4","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:34:36.570965653Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-be2720","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e7a0c28e-63ac-49ab-a4b2-8e61172afc85","text":"## Summary\n\nAll 8 sub-issues completed:\n\n1. **beats-a24553** — Modal focus trap, auto-focus, focus restoration\n2. **beats-1e720d** — Filter menu Escape handling\n3. **beats-c57e08** — `?` keyboard shortcut help overlay\n4. **beats-d86e61** — Board view keyboard nav (arrows, Enter, S/L/E, 1-5 status)\n5. **beats-3b16a4** — Notifications keyboard nav (J/K, arrows, Enter, R)\n6. **beats-9c933d** — Number-key status/priority in context menu\n7. **beats-0f271b** — Global view switching G chord (7 targets)\n8. **beats-fc2d80** — `/` to focus backlog search\n\nAdditional work done under this epic:\n- Shared StatusPicker, PriorityPicker, EstimatePicker components\n- Filter menu submenu keyboard fixes\n- Renamed Inbox → Notifications with bell icon"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:36:29.844860308Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-be2720","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:36:33.988095198Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-be2720","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\n\nAudit of keyboard navigation across the Web UI. The backlog and issue detail views have good coverage (J/K nav, S/L/E/P/A shortcuts, number-key status changes). But several views have no keyboard support at all, modals don't trap focus, and there's no way for users to discover available shortcuts.\n\n## Release-blocking\n\nThese create a broken or frustrating experience for keyboard users:\n\n### Focus management in modals\n- Modals (new issue, merge confirmation) have no focus trap — Tab escapes the modal\n- No auto-focus on first input when modal opens\n- No focus restoration when modal closes\n- Files: `Modal.tsx`, `NewIssueModal.tsx`\n\n### Filter menu traps keyboard in backlog\n- When the filter menu is open (`F` key), all backlog keyboard nav is disabled\n- Escape doesn't close the filter menu — user must click elsewhere\n- File: `Backlog.tsx` line 693\n\n### Keyboard shortcut discoverability\n- No help overlay or cheat sheet (`?` key is the convention)\n- Shortcuts exist but users can't discover them without reading code\n- Accelerator hints should appear in context menus, popovers, and toolbar buttons\n\n## High priority (pre-release polish)\n\n### Board view — zero keyboard nav\n- No arrow key navigation between columns or cards\n- No Enter to open card detail\n- No status shortcuts (S/L/E) on focused card\n- Only dnd-kit's built-in keyboard drag exists\n- File: `Board.tsx`\n\n### Inbox — zero keyboard nav\n- No J/K or arrow key navigation between issue groups\n- No Enter to open linked issue\n- No keyboard shortcut to mark all as read\n- File: `Inbox.tsx`\n\n### Number-key status in context menu submenus\n- Issue detail supports 1-5 for status changes\n- Context menu status submenu (right-click on backlog row) doesn't support number selection\n- Inconsistent: same UI, different keyboard behavior\n- File: `ContextMenu.tsx`\n\n## Nice-to-have (post-release)\n\n### Global view switching\n- Number keys (e.g., `G` then `B` for board, `G` then `I` for inbox) or direct shortcuts\n- Currently only reachable via command palette\n\n### Dashboard keyboard nav\n- Arrow key navigation through attention items, epics, workload entries\n- Enter to jump to linked issue\n\n### Search focus shortcut\n- `/` to focus the backlog search input (common convention)\n- Currently unreachable without mouse or multiple Tab presses\n\n### Consistent J/K everywhere\n- Backlog and issue detail support J/K (vim-style)\n- Board, inbox, dashboard don't\n- Should work in any list context\n\n## Current coverage matrix\n\n| View | Arrow/J/K nav | Shortcuts | Enter to open | Escape to close |\n|------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| Command Palette | Yes | — | Yes | Yes |\n| Backlog | Yes | S/L/E/F/. | Yes | — |\n| Issue Detail | Yes (prev/next) | S/L/E/P/A/M/1-5/. | — | Yes |\n| Board | No | No | No | — |\n| Inbox | No | No | No | — |\n| Dashboard | No | No | No | — |\n| Modals | — | Cmd+Enter | — | Yes (no trap) |"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:44:39.304440819Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-a24553","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nModals (new issue, merge confirmation) don't trap keyboard focus — Tab escapes the modal into the background. No auto-focus on first input when opening, no focus restoration when closing.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add focus trap to `Modal.tsx` (prevent Tab from escaping)\n- Auto-focus first focusable element on open\n- Restore focus to trigger element on close\n- Apply to `NewIssueModal.tsx`, merge confirmation, and any other modal consumers\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/ui/Modal.tsx`\n- `web/src/components/NewIssueModal/NewIssueModal.tsx`\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/MergeView.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:16.381295719Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-1e720d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nWhen the backlog filter menu is open (via `F` key), all keyboard navigation is disabled and Escape doesn't close it. User must click elsewhere with the mouse — keyboard trap with no exit.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Add Escape handler to close filter menu\n- Restore backlog keyboard nav after filter menu closes\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` (line ~693)\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/FilterMenu.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:17.738931313Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-c57e08","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nShortcuts exist but are undiscoverable — users can't find them without reading code.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `?` key opens a help overlay listing all keyboard shortcuts\n- Grouped by context: Global, Backlog, Issue Detail, Board, etc.\n- Overlay closes on Escape or `?` again\n- Add accelerator hints to context menus, popovers, and toolbar buttons where applicable\n\n## Files\n- New component: `web/src/components/KeyboardHelp/`\n- `web/src/App.tsx` (register `?` global shortcut)\n- Various components for inline hints"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:19.142414005Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-d86e61","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nBoard view has zero keyboard navigation — only dnd-kit's built-in keyboard drag exists.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Arrow Up/Down (or J/K): navigate cards within a column\n- Arrow Left/Right: move focus between columns\n- Enter: open focused card's detail view\n- S/L/E shortcuts on focused card (same as backlog)\n- Visual focus indicator on active card\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/Board/Board.tsx`\n- `web/src/components/Board/BoardCard.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:20.142928645Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3b16a4","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nInbox has no keyboard support at all.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Arrow Up/Down (or J/K): navigate between issue groups\n- Enter: open the linked issue\n- Visual focus indicator on active group\n- Keyboard shortcut to mark all as read\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:31.351433531Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-9c933d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nIssue detail supports 1-5 for quick status changes, but the context menu's status submenu (right-click on backlog row) doesn't. Same UI, different keyboard behavior.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Add 1-5 number key handlers in the status submenu of `ContextMenu.tsx`\n- Match the ordering used in issue detail: 1=Backlog, 2=Planned, 3=Doing, 4=Blocked, 5=Done\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/ui/ContextMenu.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:32.60768844Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-0f271b","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nSwitching between views (backlog, board, inbox, dashboard) requires the command palette or mouse clicks on the sidebar.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `G` then `I`: switch to Issues\n- `G` then `B`: switch to Board\n- `G` then `O`: switch to Overview\n- `G` then `N`: switch to Notifications\n- `G` then `D`: switch to Dependencies\n- `G` then `L`: switch to Labels\n- `G` then `C`: switch to Cycles\n- Two-key chord: `G` sets a pending state (with 1s timeout), second key completes the nav\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/App.tsx` (global handler)\n- `web/src/components/KeyboardHelp/KeyboardHelp.tsx` (help overlay)"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:35.011706445Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-fc2d80","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nBacklog search input is unreachable without mouse or many Tab presses.\n\n## Fix\n\n- `/` key focuses the search input when in backlog view (common convention: GitHub, Slack, etc.)\n- Escape from search returns focus to the issue list\n- Ensure `/` doesn't fire when already in an editable target\n\n## Files\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:45:35.787977135Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
