{"id":"beats-603536","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3850dd3b-9035-4645-891f-7d293f40e8cd","text":"## Summary\n\nEnhanced the existing GitHub Actions release workflow with checksums and CHANGELOG-based release notes.\n\n### Checksums\n- `sha256sum beats-* \u003e checksums.txt` generated after all binaries are collected\n- `checksums.txt` uploaded alongside binaries in the GitHub Release\n\n### CHANGELOG-based release body\n- Replaced `generate_release_notes: true` with awk extraction of the tagged version's section from `CHANGELOG.md`\n- Extracts everything between `## [x.y.z]` and the next `## [` header\n- Uses GitHub Actions heredoc output to pass multi-line body to `softprops/action-gh-release`\n\n### What was already in place (unchanged)\n- Frontend build + artifact upload\n- Cross-compilation matrix: linux/darwin/windows x amd64/arm64\n- `v*` tag trigger\n- `softprops/action-gh-release` for GitHub Release creation\n\n### Not done (post-release)\n- Goreleaser migration (overkill for now, current workflow works)\n- Homebrew tap formula\n- Binary signing (checksums provide verification, signing can come later)\n\n### Files changed\n- `.github/workflows/build.yml` — added checksums step, changelog extraction, replaced auto release notes"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:07:41.635439189Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
